<Slide style={{ width:'1280px', height:'720px', padding:'44px', background:'#FFFFFF', fontFamily:'sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'126px', justifyContent:'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:10 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:13, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#185FA5', letterSpacing:1.6 }}>마무리</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:11, color:'#94A3B8' }}>질문 받겠습니다</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize:52, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0B2136', marginTop:4, lineHeight:1.05 }}>Q <span style={{ color:'#185FA5' }}>&</span> A</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'1px', background:'#E3EAF2' }} />

  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'456px', marginTop:'18px', flexDirection:'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ width:'100%', background:'#F6F8FB', borderRadius:12, padding:'18px 22px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:15, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#185FA5' }}>Q. 왜 SQLite 인가요?</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:13.5, color:'#33475B', marginTop:4 }}>스키마·쿼리를 그대로 두고 엔진만 교체할 수 있게 설계했습니다. PostgreSQL 이식 경로는 문서화돼 있습니다.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width:'100%', background:'#F6F8FB', borderRadius:12, padding:'18px 22px', marginTop:14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:15, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#0F6E56' }}>Q. 3D 는 어디까지 했나요?</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:13.5, color:'#33475B', marginTop:4 }}>이번 학기 범위에서 3D 아트는 제외했습니다(실행방안 명시). GLB 교체 경로는 확보해 두었습니다.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width:'100%', background:'#F6F8FB', borderRadius:12, padding:'18px 22px', marginTop:14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:15, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#A06A00' }}>Q. 아이가 정말 다시 오나요?</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:13.5, color:'#33475B', marginTop:4 }}>지표 도구는 완성됐습니다. W13 에 5~10명 실측으로 답하겠습니다.</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width:'100%', background:'#0E2438', borderRadius:14, padding:'20px 24px', marginTop:18 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:16 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:13, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#9FB6CC', width:110 }}>데모</Text>
        <Text style={{ flex:1, fontSize:19, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#FFFFFF' }}>https://my-dorobot.app.workbuddy.host/</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection:'row', alignItems:'center', gap:16, marginTop:10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize:13, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#9FB6CC', width:110 }}>GitHub</Text>
        <Text style={{ flex:1, fontSize:17, fontWeight:'bold', color:'#C7D7E6' }}>https://github.com/lmm0125-art/roomi</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize:13, color:'#C7D7E6', marginTop:12 }}>시작 화면 「🎬 데모 계정으로 바로 보기」 → Lv.5 · 6일 연속 · 320셀　│　부록 p.10 = 전체 ER</Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ width:'100%', height:'28px', marginTop:12, flexDirection:'row', justifyContent:'space-between', alignItems:'center' }}>
